# Folder Structure

Follow `docs/FOLDER-STRUCTURE.md` exactly.

- Pages: `app/(marketing)/`
- Components: `components/{layout,home,products,ui,animations}/`
- Data: `data/*.json` — never import in components
- Lib: `lib/getData.ts`, `lib/types.ts`
- Docs: update matching file in `docs/components/` or `docs/pages/`

Do not create alternate paths (e.g. `src/components`, `utils/`).
